
title: PlantLady
---
<<declare $plantLady_interaction_times = 0>>
<<declare $gave_plant = false>>
<<declare $has_plant = false>>

<<if $plantLady_interaction_times == 0>>
  Haruka: Oh, neighbor! I'm glad I ran into you.
  Haruka: We've never really talked to each other, but I've always meant to show you my plants!
  -> Your plants?
  -> I'd love to see them!
    Haruka: I'd love to show you! There are so many now that I don't think you'd be able to see them all though.
  Haruka: I started growing them a while ago with a little succulent, and then I just couldn't stop.
  Haruka: I always wanted to give you one of my plants. But I was never brave enough to knock on your door.
  Haruka: Here, take it with you. I'm glad I could finally give it to you.
  -> Thank you so much!
  -> I can't take this...
    Haruka: No, I insist.
  <<PlaySound InteractionManager "Pickup">>
  You got a plant from Haruka!
  Haruka: Maybe you could give it to someone else who needs it. I'd love for you to share my love further.
  Haruka: If you had any plant of your own, I would also love to meet it!
  <<set $has_plant = true>>
  <<set $plantLady_interaction_times = 1>>
<<elseif $plantLady_interaction_times >= 1 and $has_tomatoes>>
  You: Haruka! I found this plant in my apartment. Would you like to have it?
  Haruka: Cherry tomatoes! I'd love to.
  -> I'm glad you can take care of it.
  -> Wait... tomatoes?
    You: I never got any tomatoes from it...
    Haruka: Tomatoes are a tricky bunch. Staying indoors might have made it shy.
  Haruka: I'll make sure it's happy! Thank you so much! 
  <<set $has_tomatoes = false>>
<<elseif $plantLady_interaction_times >= 1 and $gave_plant>>
  You: Haruka! I gave the plant to Tanakah. He really liked it.
  Haruka: That makes me so happy. Thank you for spreading my love.
  <<set $gave_plant = false>>
<<else>>
  Haruka: Hi, neighbor! I hope you find joy in the plants.
<<endif>>

===

